      "instance_name": "concept_patriotic_outrage",
      "label": "Concept: Patriotic Outrage",
      "description": "The meme uses the rhetoric of patriotism to incite anger and a sense of national crisis, framing the perceived threat to 'America' as a justification for racially charged aggression. This concept is used to manipulate viewers into accepting the meme's hateful message under the guise of defending national identity.",
