      "description": "The meme urges viewers to 'stop being afraid of being called a racist,' which is a rhetorical device used to normalize and justify racist behavior by framing it as a necessary response to perceived threats. Understanding the concept of 'racist accusation' as a social and political tool is essential to interpret the meme's message.",
